--Spoilers--

The classic way is to obtain holy water (blessed potions of water)
somehow, and then dip whatever you want to bless into a potion of holy
water.

How to get holy water?  On older versions of nethack (pre 3.1), drop
water onto a lawful altar.  Under 3.1, you can get holy water by
dropping potions of water onto a coaligned altar and then praying -- but
make sure that your deity is reasonably happy with you first.

It's a good idea to get as many potions of water as you can when doing
this, so dilute useless potions in a moat or fountain first.

